WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:08.860
<i>The treasurer of the four-member
student council at Shuchiin Academy...</i>

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.230
<i>Yu Ishigami.</i>

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.580
<i>The man who is indispensable
to the student council,</i>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.200
<i>yet hasn't made
much of an impression on them.</i>

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.080
<i>The man Shirogane,
the president of the student council,</i>

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.960
<i>chose to be the treasurer
based on expectations of his prowess.</i>

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.000
Here's this month's financial report.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.750
Great.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.630
<i>He has been biding his time...</i>

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:34.630
What is it?

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.760
I want to quit the student council.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>...waiting for the chance
to resign from the student council!</i>

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.480
I see. Quit the student council...

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.240
YU ISHIGAMI WANTS TO LIVE

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.240
You've got to be kidding me!
Without you, we'll go bankrupt!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.740
I'm begging you here!

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.740
<i>Yu Ishigami.</i>

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.580
<i>He's a data processing expert.</i>

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:30.370
<i>At Shuchiin Academy,
only the president is elected.</i>

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.120
PRESIDENT
MIYUKI SHIROGANE

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.620
VICE-PRESIDENT
KAGUYA SHINOMIYA

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.750
SECRETARY
CHIKA FUJIWARA

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.750
TREASURER
YU ISHIGAMI

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:34.250
<i>The other members are appointed
based on their abilities.</i>

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.460
<i>Yu Ishigami is a talented person
who was scouted by the student council...</i>

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.760
<i>despite the fact that he had barely begun
his first year there.</i>

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.390
<i>Normally he takes his work home</i>

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:45.600
<i>and only shows up
in the student council room for meetings,</i>

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.680
<i>but he is a full-fledged council member.</i>

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.440
<i>Undeniably, Yu Ishigami is the treasurer
of Shuchiin Academy's student council.</i>

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:55.860
<i>And now he is trying to quit his post.</i>

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.280
But I've got an important reason.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.030
<i>That reason is...</i>

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.030
What reason?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.910
I think I'm going to be murdered.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:03.950
Murdered?

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:07.790
I think Shinomiya-senpai
is going to kill me.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.160
Shino...

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.160
O-On what basis do you think that?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:11.920
Her eyes.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.670
Eyes?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:17.130
<i>People's eyes are organs
that are connected directly to the brain.</i>

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.420
<i>Normally half of the brain
is used to process the sense of sight.</i>

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.510
<i>The movement of eyes can show
what someone is cautious about or hungry for.</i>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.560
<i>Those organs clearly reveal
the brain's activity.</i>

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.560
FOOD > CAT
GLUTTON

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.560
DOG > FOOD
SCAREDY-CAT

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:32.940
I can tell five or six percent of a person's
true character just by looking into their eyes.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.610
That's not much!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.980
I can probably do the same!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:41.700
The way Shinomiya-senpai
looks at me sometimes...

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.370
I'm positive that the intent to kill
is in that glance.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.700
What exactly happened?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.000
It was a month ago.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.590
COFFEE BLEND
FREE TICKET

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:06.550
But a lot of people think
that's the best way to kill time.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.720
<i>What is this?</i>

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.350
I don't really go to coffee shops.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.640
They're too expensive for my blood.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:13.730
You have a point.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.730
If there was a coupon or something,
it would be different.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:21.990
PAT PAT

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:21.990
Yeah.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.990
If it were cheaper,
I wouldn't mind going once in a while.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.460
Not a word to anyone about those tickets.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.460
<i>What happened?</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.590
She threatened me, so I can't tell you.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.630
Threatened?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.890
I have a feeling
she's killed two or three people already.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:49.970
What happened?

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.390
And then last week, too...

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:58.690
<i>Shinomiya-senpai,
are you in love with the president?</i>

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.980
FSSST

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.780
<i>In love with the president?</i>

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:05.320
<i>Don't talk nonsense!
That would never happen!</i>

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.070
<i>You don't see him as a love interest?</i>

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.080
<i>N-No!</i>

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.410
<i>Of course not.</i>

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.200
<i>Really?</i>

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.170
<i>In fact, rumors like that are a nuisance!</i>

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.920
<i>Is that right?</i>

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.670
<i>I thought they'd make a good couple.</i>

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:27.220
<i>Then I'll give the president a hint
that you have no romantic interest.</i>

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.940
YANK YANK

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.520
<i>You'll tell him no such thing!</i>

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.940
<i>You hear me?</i>

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.690
I think she has the skills
of a trained assassin.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.940
A trained assassin?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.490
Using the corner of a couch
to strangle me... That's a pro!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.820
What do you think Shinomiya is?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:56.080
SHIVER SHIVER

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.080
My guess is she's a natural-born serial killer.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.950
I can see it in her eyes.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.080
You put too much faith
in that five or six percent!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.460
Fujiwara-senpai's
in even more danger than me.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.500
Sometimes Shinomiya-senpai stares
at her as if she's less than human.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.010
I estimate she's got
another two months left.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.630
You calculated her life expectancy?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.590
Ridiculous!

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.720
No, that type
is the most dangerous predator.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.100
President...

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.100
Is Ishigami here?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.730
I was at a meeting.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.860
Don't make it worse for yourself!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.860
It was about the budget
for the drama club.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.690
Turn yourself in, Shinomiya!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.150
Please!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.360
Listen when someone's talking to you!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.620
BEND BEND

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.830
I told you I was helping
the drama club, remember?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.210
Today was the costume fitting.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.880
O-Oh.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.130
Still, you didn't need
to bring that prop in here.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:50.380
Um, I just wanted
to tease you a little with it.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.010
Sorry.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.470
<i>Cute.</i>

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.350
Shirogane-senpai, this is a trap.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.520
She's playing it cute
so you'll let your guard down.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.610
D-Don't scare me like that!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.900
That's just a costume!
Shinomiya hasn't killed anyone!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.110
President!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.780
Help.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.330
Miss Kaguya killed me!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.080
Then it's true!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:24.790
What's true?
She's just wearing special makeup!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.340
Oh, right!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.090
No, President. This is a trap, too.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.090
I suspect she really is dead,

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.010
but Shinomiya-senpai performed
some mad-science surgery on her.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.600
Ishigami...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.350
You always let imagination
get the better of you.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.600
Shinomiya would never murder a soul.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.230
Try to have more faith in your colleagues.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:45.610
Okay?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.610
Faith in my colleagues...

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.530
Anyway, that's impressive.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.610
I know, right?

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.370
How is that attached?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.740
It's like this. See?

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.330
Sorry I asked.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.290
Faith in my colleagues...

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.830
Ishigami...

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.500
About our secret...

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.590
I appreciate that you've kept it to yourself.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.140
Being tight-lipped is a virtue, right?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.640
If you had blabbed...

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.230
Faith!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.190
STAB

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.400
...this wouldn't be a toy.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:32.280
Also, don't put the president in a bind.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.610
Please don't say
anything more about resigning.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.700
Do you want to try
stabbing me, President?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.830
<i>Then was she...</i>

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.160
Can I? I wanted to try it once.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.540
<i>listening the whole time?</i>

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:58.930
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:
ISHIGAMI LOSES

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.300
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:58.930
WANTS TO QUIT BECAUSE
HE'S AFRAID OF KAGUYA
BUT CAN'T QUIT BECAUSE
HE'S AFRAID OF KAGUYA

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.930
<i>Ishigami loses.</i>

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.930
WOMEN WHO LOVE AND HATE

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:08.690
CAGE FOR CATS

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.690
There's an animal cage in front of you.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.690
How many cats are in the cage?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.820
What kind of abstract question is that?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:14.780
CHIKA FUJIWARA
WANTS TO TEST YOU

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.150
It's a psychological test!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.530
It's from a book
I borrowed from the library.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.740
Just by answering this question,

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:22.450
I'll be able to understand
the depths of your mind, President.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.290
That's silly.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:27.420
As if you could understand the workings
of the mind with a question like that.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.420
Come on, just humor me.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.300
How many cats?

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.260
I guess about nine cats.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.800
That tells me
how many children you want!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.810
<i>That's exactly right!</i>

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.560
Nine kids? That's like a baseball team!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.560
<i>Nine kids? That many?</i>

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:50.690
PSYCHOLOGY TEST

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.560
<i>Psychology tests.</i>

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.690
<i>Abstract questions that draw out
what someone really thinks.</i>

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:55.070
<i>Most of them have amusing game elements
that employ the Barnum effect,</i>

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.610
<i>but some of them are practical
and based on actual psychology.</i>

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.490
<i>The person who thinks of these tests
only as an amusing trifle</i>

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.580
<i>and lets their guard down
may be in for a bitter experience.</i>

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.210
I've got another really interesting one!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.130
Let's do it together!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.550
Oh, us, too?

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:13.340
Yes!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.720
Are you ready?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:20.090
"You're walking down a dark path.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.220
Suddenly, someone taps you
on the shoulder from behind.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.430
Who is that person?"

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.140
Give me a hint.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.900
This isn't a quiz,
so it doesn't work that way.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:31.730
Oh.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.110
A dark path...

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.940
What could this be getting at?

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:41.030
<i>There it is!
The second question on page 47!</i>

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.240
<i>That answer...</i>

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.740
THAT'S THE PERSON YOU'RE IN LOVE WITH!!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.740
<i>indicates whom you're in love with!</i>

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.080
<i>If you say the name
of someone of the opposite sex</i>

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.500
<i>it's like a confession of love!</i>

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.250
<i>As is often the case,
Kaguya had prepared for this situation.</i>

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.750
PLEASE TYPE IN A NAME

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.750
CHIKA FUJIWARA'S BRAIN

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.880
<i>Kaguya has known Chika Fujiwara
since middle school</i>

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.510
<i>and is especially familiar
with her behavioral patterns.</i>

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.510
CHIKA'S BRAIN

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.510
LOVE, PLAYING, EATING, PESU

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:04.220
<i>Ever since Kaguya noticed
the book was on the library's list of purchases,</i>

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:08.020
<i>she predicted a high likelihood of Fujiwara
bringing it to the student council room.</i>

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.020
PSYCHOLOGY TESTS FOR LOVE

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.770
<i>Kaguya read the book in advance!</i>

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.860
"Question. You bring a squirrel home.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.030
<i>She's able to avoid any dangerous answers.</i>

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.030
What do you do with it then?"

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.490
Let's see. I would make
delicious food for it every day...

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.950
and give it a massage
before it went to sleep.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.620
The answer is...

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:27.200
"After you get married,
what will you do for your spouse?"

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.210
<i>In other words,</i>

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.870
<i>by being able to negotiate this minefield
called a "psychological test,"</i>

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.460
<i>she holds a huge advantage.</i>

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:38.210
Let me think.
It would be you, Miss Fujiwara.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.760
M-Me?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.680
BASHFUL BASHFUL

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.550
<i>A dark path...</i>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.690
<i>Why are you running away, Ishigami?</i>

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.860
My answer is Shinomiya-senpai.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.030
Me?

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.200
<i>That's how Ishigami feels?</i>

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.410
<i>He's a nice boy, and I don't dislike him...</i>

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.000
<i>but I'm sorry.
Ishigami is on the level of a worm to me.</i>

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.960
<i>Ishigami is rejected.</i>

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.300
<i>Now the president is the real issue.</i>

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.720
<i>I hate dark, scary places.</i>

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.680
<i>President, let's go home together.</i>

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.180
Well, I—

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.100
Grin!

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.360
<i>Wait! Why is Fujiwara
grinning at me like that?</i>

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.360
GRIN GRIN

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:39.900
<i>She called it "really interesting."</i>

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.280
<i>A question
that love-obsessed girl pounced on...</i>

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.410
<i>This one is definitely not a harmless test!</i>

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.160
<i>If the answer is
"The person you're in love with..."</i>

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.580
<i>Oh, President...</i>

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.870
<i>So, you're subconsciously
in love with me?</i>

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.330
<i>How cute.</i>

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.250
<i>It would be like a confession of love!</i>

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:03.470
<i>The best answer would be someone they'd be
satisfied with, but nobody in this room!</i>

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.760
<i>Then...</i>

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.510
I guess my little sister.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.890
"The person who taps you on the shoulder
indicates the person you're in love with."

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.520
In short, the president
has a sister complex.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.360
That's the most boring answer.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.530
That's right. I have a sister complex.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.780
<i>I'm in love with Shinomiya-senpai?</i>

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.620
<i>No, I think this emotion is terror!</i>

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.540
President, I think I have
Stockholm syndrome, so I'm going home.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.550
A-All right. Get well soon.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:47.180
It could also be
the suspension bridge effect.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.430
I'll go to a hospital on the way home.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.600
I wanna try answering one myself,
so I'll look on the net.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.190
<i>Shoot! Miss Fujiwara is looking
for a question outside of the book!</i>

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.520
This one's cute!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.400
"You're in a field of flowers.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:07.360
The owner said you can take home
as many flowers as you like.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.570
How many will you take home?"

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.280
<i>A question she doesn't know the answer to!</i>

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.040
Flowers, huh?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:18.120
I'd carefully pick only the prettiest ones.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.380
So just a couple.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:27.170
I-I suppose I'd take enough
to make a lovely bouquet.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.760
I see.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.850
<i>What should I do?
I answered honestly without thinking!</i>

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.220
How many for you, President?

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.350
<i>Well, unlike that last one,
I don't have to say a name,</i>

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.850
<i>so I can answer it normally.</i>

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.650
I can take as many as I like
for free, right?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.690
Then there's only one possible answer.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:51.200
HEAP

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.990
I'd take as many
as I could cram into a truck!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.200
Maybe even a truck wouldn't be enough.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.450
That's a poor person's mentality.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.580
What would you do
with all of those flowers?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.710
Well, I could give some away
and sell some, right?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.210
<i>Um, the answer is...</i>

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:00.580
CLICK HERE FOR THE ANSWER

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.710
THE AMOUNT OF FLOWERS YOU TOOK INDICATES
HOW MUCH LOVE YOU HAVE FOR A SPECIAL SOMEONE!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.180
What was the answer?

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:22.100
Nothing. Um, "How much
you love flowers" or something.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.060
Yes, that's what it was.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.190
Even though I love flowers?

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.610
Silly.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.860
I don't agree with that one!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.900
Neither do I.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.160
But that's what the answer was.
We just have to accept it.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:34.370
REASON:
HAVING A TRUCK
 FULL OF LOVE

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.860
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.370
<i>Shirogane loses.</i>

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.370
I guess you're right.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.870
COST OF A FAMILY

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.870
UM, IF YOU GET A HCG INJECTION,
THERE'S A 20% HIGHER CHANCE
OF GIVING BIRTH TO TWINS...

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.870
AH... HUH...

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.370
Wanna get a smoothie on the way home?

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.040
Okay!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.250
- I'm gonna get celery!
- What kind should I get?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.220
I'm totally sorry.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:53.010
I'm working again today.
I have to go straight there.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.430
Again?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.930
You work too much.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.060
Next time, definitely!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.060
Yeah, okay!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.770
It's time to go home, Lady Kaguya.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.280
Hayasaka, I told you not to come
to the student council room.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:14.410
I've confirmed that the president
and the other members have already left.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:16.490
KAGUYA WANTS
TO BE NOTICED

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.660
Rest assured.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.370
Carelessness like that can be fatal.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.040
Recently, you've become lax, haven't you?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.250
Between your appearance,
those nails,

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.090
UNBUTTONED
HER
COLLAR

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.750
NAILS

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.840
MYSTERIOUS
KEYCHAIN

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.840
and your skirt length,
you're likely violating school rules.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.840
ROLLED UP HER SKIRT

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.800
It's all within the bounds
of school regulations.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.220
Although you could say
I'm bending the rules a bit.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.800
A bit.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:39.010
For us, beauty is power.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.810
BEAUTY IS LIVE AMMO

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.520
High society is not for people
without adornment.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.820
You don't want opportunities stolen by women
with only good looks going for them.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.690
I would say you're too stuffy about it,
Lady Kaguya.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:56.030
Lately, lightly polished nails
are even in style here.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:00.330
If you want men to think you're cute,
you should take an interest.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.210
Really? Then will the president...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.580
I mean, will boys think I'm cute?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.340
After all this time, I'm surprised
you haven't given yourself away.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.340
But, yes, of course.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:17.340
<i>Hayasaka realized that nails had little to do
with popularity amongst the opposite sex.</i>

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.930
Boys will...

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.970
Come on. Let's go home and paint your nails.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:27.650
<i>But she gave only vague answers
in her desire to give Kaguya some glam.</i>

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.850
Are you sure about this?

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.020
It's okay.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.650
What's okay? Hey!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.230
THE NEXT DAY

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.240
<i>Gel nails which don't infringe
on the school dress code.</i>

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:39.070
<i>The modesty of rhinestone only
on each ring finger was part of the appeal.</i>

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.040
<i>I wonder what the president will think.</i>

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.750
<i>Will he think it's cute?</i>

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>Or maybe he'll think it's frivolous.</i>

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.170
<i>What's the nail polish about?</i>

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.920
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.600
<i>I don't want it in that case.</i>

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.640
<i>I'll just go home today, and...</i>

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.890
What are you doing, Shinomiya?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.900
Aren't you going in?

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.860
Well, I was on my way in!

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:15.780
Miss Kaguya!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.070
About this part...

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.660
Yes, what is it?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.910
Are you hiding something behind you?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.120
No, nothing.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.210
<i>The only times she's quick on the uptake
are situations like this!</i>

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.760
<i>If someone's going to notice,
I want it to be the president.</i>

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.550
<i>Certainly not her!</i>

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.260
<i>I have to get closer.</i>

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.850
Here, President.
The minutes from our last meeting.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.560
Oh, thanks.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.560
Stare.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.820
And there's an error here.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.940
You're right.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.700
Indeed.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.950
Good eye!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.450
<i>He didn't notice!</i>

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.200
<i>Shinomiya is being fashionable!</i>

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.000
<i>Jeez, why?</i>

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.210
<i>Is it because you're not interested in me?</i>

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.250
<i>What caused the change?</i>

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.720
<i>She's always avoided ornamentation,
saying, "Does a swan dress up?"</i>

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.720
<i>What should I do?
Should I mention it?</i>

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.010
<i>You have nice childbearing hips.</i>

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.600
<i>Wouldn't that actually
be sexual harassment if I did?</i>

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:34.980
LITTLE SISTER

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.180
<i>Like the other day...</i>

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.640
<i>Kei, isn't that skirt too short?</i>

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:36.320
<i>I'm not wearing this for you.
That's sexual harassment. Drop dead.</i>

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.860
<i>I was just worried about her
as a big brother!</i>

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.990
<i>If there's a reaction from a person
other than the person you want,</i>

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.370
<i>it's sexual harassment.</i>

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:47.620
<i>But since I did notice,
I should say something, right?</i>

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:51.370
<i>I'm sure she won't be any crueler to me
than my little sister was!</i>

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.500
Fujiwara-senpai...

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.760
You changed your conditioner, didn't you?

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:01.970
You can tell?

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.260
Yeah, well...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.260
the smell is different than usual.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.890
I mean, it is stuffy in here today,

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.770
but it's cute that the smell
is stronger than usual.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.860
It kind of smells like a baby.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.400
Ishigami...

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.530
That's creepy!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.620
<i>Let me die.</i>

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.040
I want to die, so I'm going home.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.790
S-Sure. But don't die.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.960
<i>It smelled good,</i>

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.130
<i>so I meant to give her a compliment.</i>

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.260
Do I smell? Am I stinky?

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.680
<i>That's tough!</i>

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:49.010
<i>The day Shinomiya calls me creepy,
I'm likely to choose death myself!</i>

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:53.020
SNIFF SNIFF

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.020
<i>I'd better not bring up her nails!</i>

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.140
<i>It's just too risky!</i>

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.770
<i>I can't risk having her call me "creepy"!</i>

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.900
<i>Wait. Is that just an excuse?</i>

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.990
<i>This is my issue.</i>

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.780
<i>Complimenting Shinomiya's nails...</i>

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:13.710
<i>I'm just genuinely bashful.</i>

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.800
<i>In the end, he didn't notice my nails.</i>

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:29.720
<i>But it's probably better that way.</i>

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:35.270
<i>It's meaningless for me
to be fashion-conscious.</i>

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:40.070
<i>It doesn't make me cute.</i>

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.990
Shinomiya!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.820
Those nails!

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.580
C-C-C-C-Cu...

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.170
Never mind! Nothing!

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.210
What?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.590
Finish what you were going to say!

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:07.180
The president is cute
when he's all flustered, isn't he?

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:12.350
Jeez! Jeez!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.350
<i>You, too, Kaguya.</i>

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.020
I-I wonder what he was about to say!

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:18.770
What do you think, Hayasaka?

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:21.770
"Hayasaka," I said!

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.360
He said, "Those nails!"

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:29.870
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:
KAGUYA WINS

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:24.360
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.700
Come on, Hayasaka!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.030
<i>Kaguya wins.</i>
